===Etymology===
{{PIE word|en|tréyes}}{{root|en|ine-pro|*ped-}}
{{multiple images
|direction = vertical
|image1 = Teapoy with four oval tea caddies MET DP-14129-168.jpg
|image2 = Teapoy with four oval tea caddies MET DP-14129-170.jpg
|caption2 = A late-18th-[[century]] [[British#Adjective|British]] teapoy, with its [[lid#Noun|lid]] [[open#Adjective|open]] ''(bottom)'' to [[reveal#Verb|reveal]] [[tea caddy|tea caddies]] and a [[box#Noun|box]].{{ref|group=n|name=n1|From the collection of the {{w|Metropolitan Museum of Art}} in [[New York City]], [[New York]], USA.}}
